        "3.1": "By [F4] and [F5], the identical data on the two sides satisfy the same specialized physical equations from [F7]. This establishes a coordinate correspondence between exact model solutions only; no extension through the excluded surface or center follows. [given, F4, F5, F7, A1, step 2.1] \u220e"
